[h1]Cosmic Starfall[/h1]
[i]The expansive sci-fi fantasy arsenal and high-tech subsystem modernization for the Cosmic Series.[/i]

[hr][/hr]

[h2]⚠️ CRITICAL: NEW SAVE FILE HARD REQUIRED ⚠️[/h2]
[b]The massive [THE ASCENSION ERA] update has completely overhauled the internal architecture of the Cosmic Series.[/b]
Attempting to load an existing save will cause severe corruption and crashes due to the massive structural changes. You [b]MUST[/b] start a new galaxy to play!

[hr][/hr]

[h2]What is Cosmic Starfall?[/h2]
Cosmic Starfall adds a massive suite of new, custom-built weapons and starship subsystems designed to look spectacular and offer new ways to conquer the galaxy. Whether you are building an invincible shield-tanking dreadnought, a carrier loaded with nanobot repair beams, or a rapid-fire plasma artillery platform, Starfall provides the tools you need!

[b]⚠️ DEPENDENCY NOTE:[/b] Cosmic Starfall is an [b]OPTIONAL[/b] sci-fi fantasy expansion for the Cosmic Series. It only strictly requires [b]Cosmic Vault[/b] to function.

[hr][/hr]

[h2]Core Features[/h2]
[list]
[*]⚔️ [b]18 Custom Weapon Classes:[/b] Discover Pulse Guns, Particle Accelerators, Transphasic Lasers, Mantis Beams, Hyperkinetics, Cyclone suppression kinetics, Magnetic Mortars, Solar Torpedoes, and more!
[*]🔧 [b]11 Vanilla Weapon Overhauls:[/b] Vanilla weapons receive massive statistical buffs to stay competitive! Chainguns/Bolters roll Antimatter/Plasma variants. Lasers/Teslas gain +100-150% damage scalars.
[*]🛡️ [b]7 Custom Subsystem Modules:[/b] Equip the Aegis Shield Matrix (Bastion), Overcharged Quantum Cores, Macrofield Projectors, Pulse Tractor Beams, Repair Drones, Subspace Cargo Extensions, and Xperimental Hypergenerators for specialized endgame builds.
[*]🔗 [b]Subsystem Synergies (Set Bonuses):[/b] Equip specific module combinations like 'The Aegis Matrix' or 'Void-Runner Configuration' to unlock massive hidden buffs (e.g. +20% Recharge Rate, +20% Jump Range)!
[*]🛳️ [b]Fleet Doctrines (Turret Sets):[/b] Equip 5+ of the same turret type (e.g. 5+ Miners, 5+ Artillery, 5+ PDCs) to unlock powerful passive Fleet Doctrines across your ship!
[*]🚀 [b]Seamless Loot Integration:[/b] Drops from bosses, enemies, equipment docks, and craftable at Turret Factories. Hostile NPC fleets will use them against you!
[*]⚖️ [b]Major Balance Revamp:[/b] Normalized custom weapon DPS to a +15% to +25% margin over vanilla. Stripped flat exponential modifiers and fixed multi-projectile bugs.
[*]🔒 [b]Anti-Exploit Overhaul:[/b] Hardened scripts against "Puppeteer" exploits, Megacomplex cargo siphoning, and Arbitrary Code Execution. Fully secured for multiplayer servers!
[/list]

[h2]Documentation[/h2]
📖 Cosmic Starfall has it's own Player UI Tab for in-game wiki. Featuring all weapon & subsystem stats, mechanics and other useful information.

